1
00:01:30,460 --> 00:01:34,970
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:37,930
[Episode 20]

3
00:01:54,150 --> 00:01:55,810
How did Young Master Feng die?

4
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,880
You just killed his father not long ago,

5
00:02:07,510 --> 00:02:09,430
and you didn't even spare the son?

6
00:02:14,630 --> 00:02:15,560
What could we do?

7
00:02:17,870 --> 00:02:20,520
He chose to die for God of Wealth.

8
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,810
I didn't expect that coward

9
00:02:30,970 --> 00:02:32,900
to actually have that kind of guts.

10
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:35,329
I need to put on some makeup.

11
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:46,000
This is Shanghai.

12
00:02:46,540 --> 00:02:49,540
For all you know,
everyone here has a secret identity.

13
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,220
What a reckless idiot.

14
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,530
Way out of his depth.

15
00:03:00,590 --> 00:03:01,590
He's already dead.

16
00:03:01,590 --> 00:03:02,840
Give him a break.

17
00:03:03,870 --> 00:03:07,930
At most, he was just a lovesick fool
who gave his heart to the wrong person.

18
00:03:11,590 --> 00:03:13,150
Whatever kind of person he was,

19
00:03:13,150 --> 00:03:14,610
that's none of my concern.

20
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,000
He wasn't Yang Xiaoxian.

21
00:03:21,910 --> 00:03:22,710
Du,

22
00:03:23,590 --> 00:03:25,520
our score hasn't been settled yet.

23
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:32,079
Don't bring up Xiaoxian with me.

24
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,310
Are you scared?

25
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,570
You have too many debts.

26
00:03:40,590 --> 00:03:41,720
You think killing me

27
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:44,690
will stop people from
coming after you for them?

28
00:03:50,079 --> 00:03:51,400
Why'd you pull a gun?

29
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:03,660
The photos are developed.

30
00:04:24,870 --> 00:04:26,560
Don't get too close to
those dancing hostesses.

31
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,390
Otherwise,

32
00:04:27,830 --> 00:04:29,890
you'll be the next Young Master Feng.

33
00:04:58,909 --> 00:05:01,110
The one who died on Sanguantang Road...

34
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,240
should have been me.

35
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:10,310
Young Master Feng was
truly devoted to you.

36
00:05:11,430 --> 00:05:12,310
I admire that.

37
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,270
If...

38
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:19,390
I hadn't stolen him from Bingbing,

39
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:22,350
maybe he wouldn't have died.

40
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:25,800
Didn't you say

41
00:05:27,170 --> 00:05:28,320
everyone dies...

42
00:05:31,270 --> 00:05:32,240
sooner or later?

43
00:05:39,430 --> 00:05:41,830
How come you've become
just like me lately?

44
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,800
You heartless bastard.

45
00:05:52,310 --> 00:05:53,370
I haven't changed.

46
00:05:55,950 --> 00:05:58,350
It's just that I have to
hide my conscience.

47
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,290
I need to conserve my strength.

48
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:05,700
It's a pity
Young Master Feng died like that.

49
00:06:05,830 --> 00:06:07,030
He deserves respect.

50
00:06:11,530 --> 00:06:12,730
You're God of Wealth.

51
00:06:12,990 --> 00:06:13,870
You can't die.

52
00:06:16,070 --> 00:06:19,130
The intelligence network
can't function without you.

53
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:24,430
Who needed you
to take such a huge risk to save them?

54
00:06:27,270 --> 00:06:29,170
She's our most important undercover agent.

55
00:06:29,170 --> 00:06:32,570
She went to hand over intelligence
on Project Slumber today.

56
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:34,070
I had to keep her safe,

57
00:06:34,930 --> 00:06:36,330
even if it cost me my life.

58
00:06:37,630 --> 00:06:40,480
But that bastard Du Huangqiao
messed it up.

59
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:43,760
I have to get rid of him sooner or later.

60
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:46,110
There must be a mole.

61
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,790
Cut off all contact for now.

62
00:06:52,190 --> 00:06:53,520
What do you need me to do?

63
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:57,140
Du Huangqiao suspects me,

64
00:06:58,430 --> 00:06:59,960
and he will suspect you too.

65
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:05,070
Make sure you protect yourself.

66
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:10,090
You shouldn't have returned to
the photo studio.

67
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:15,620
Du Huangqiao won't do anything to me.

68
00:07:17,190 --> 00:07:17,950
Perhaps

69
00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:20,040
before I'm exposed...

70
00:07:22,830 --> 00:07:26,040
he'll die at the hands
of the Hurricane Team.

71
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,360
Du Huangqiao said...

72
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:35,930
I'd be the next Young Master Feng.

73
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:47,510
You won't be.

74
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:13,840
Inspector Su,

75
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:15,060
congratulations.

76
00:08:15,830 --> 00:08:17,830
Your name has finally been cleared.

77
00:08:19,630 --> 00:08:22,190
Now that you can still drink
like nothing happened,

78
00:08:22,190 --> 00:08:23,950
I suppose my so-called vindication

79
00:08:23,950 --> 00:08:25,480
is just a joke, Director Li.

80
00:08:26,390 --> 00:08:27,850
It's already good enough.

81
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,040
Inspector Su,

82
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:31,790
all my small side businesses

83
00:08:32,150 --> 00:08:34,630
have been forced to shut down.

84
00:08:36,030 --> 00:08:37,669
To keep my position,

85
00:08:38,030 --> 00:08:40,429
I even sold the houses
under my wife's name.

86
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:43,549
I haven't even dared to
go home these past few days.

87
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:48,600
Never mind the few murder cases
that were hastily wrapped up—

88
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,720
on the books,

89
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:52,720
the money recovered
is still nowhere near enough.

90
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,720
Inspector Su,

91
00:08:54,270 --> 00:08:56,600
you've worked for the Nanjing regime too.

92
00:08:56,670 --> 00:08:57,800
You should know that

93
00:08:58,550 --> 00:08:59,960
if we keep investigating,

94
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,890
it'll blow the lid off everything.

95
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:04,870
This is Shanghai.

96
00:09:05,790 --> 00:09:08,080
Who doesn't have
a little business of their own?

97
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:08,750
Of course.

98
00:09:09,670 --> 00:09:12,390
I understood that
from the moment I came to Shanghai.

99
00:09:12,390 --> 00:09:13,600
Even without you,

100
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:15,630
there will be another "Director Li"

101
00:09:15,630 --> 00:09:16,720
to take your place.

102
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:19,870
"Director Li" is just a dog.

103
00:09:24,390 --> 00:09:25,270
Inspector Su,

104
00:09:26,270 --> 00:09:27,440
we're the same.

105
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,340
We're guns in our masters' hands.

106
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,670
The Japanese sent you here
to keep me in line.

107
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:33,550
But I know

108
00:09:34,030 --> 00:09:35,480
this isn't just about me.

109
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,880
We're both smart people.

110
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:39,640
We know exactly what they want.

111
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:47,470
Then the Japanese got what they wanted.

112
00:09:49,750 --> 00:09:51,610
I'll be keeping a close eye on you.

113
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:13,850
You don't actually believe
all that nonsense they feed you, do you?

114
00:10:16,770 --> 00:10:17,890
A person has to

115
00:10:18,870 --> 00:10:21,200
believe in something in this life, right?

116
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,270
I forgot.

117
00:10:22,910 --> 00:10:24,720
You're a woman of conviction.

118
00:10:25,870 --> 00:10:27,470
And you're not, Director Li?

119
00:10:29,670 --> 00:10:30,440
Conviction?

120
00:10:31,150 --> 00:10:32,030
No offense,

121
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:34,800
but to me, it's just a lie
that gets people high.

122
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,960
This "ism" or that "ism"—

123
00:10:37,390 --> 00:10:38,650
when you get down to it,

124
00:10:38,870 --> 00:10:40,330
it all comes down to money.

125
00:10:42,150 --> 00:10:44,670
Inspector Su, would you say money

126
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:45,890
counts as faith?

127
00:10:48,510 --> 00:10:49,870
For you, Director Li,

128
00:10:50,630 --> 00:10:51,490
I'd say it does.

129
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:55,530
Then what do you believe in, Inspector Su?

130
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,960
The Greater East Asia Co-Prosperity Sphere?

131
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,960
The Three Principles of the People?

132
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,080
Surely not...

133
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,750
communism, right?

134
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:08,960
Trying to frame me again?

135
00:11:11,550 --> 00:11:13,840
You're being oversensitive, Inspector Su.

136
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:15,040
Take me, for example—

137
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:17,270
put gold on the table,

138
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:20,810
and people will
throw themselves into the fire for you.

139
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,000
Tell me,

140
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,790
is that an "ism"

141
00:11:26,390 --> 00:11:27,200
or a business?

142
00:11:33,270 --> 00:11:35,470
What you're talking about is business.

143
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,800
It has nothing to do with "isms."

144
00:11:38,550 --> 00:11:41,080
Then let's discuss this
as a business matter.

145
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:43,140
From the Treaty of Nanking until now,

146
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:45,120
how many unequal treaties have we signed?

147
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,790
And how many losing deals have we made?

148
00:11:46,790 --> 00:11:47,650
After all that,

149
00:11:47,870 --> 00:11:49,870
haven't we still ended up like this?

150
00:11:52,870 --> 00:11:55,800
A China that only talks about
business and not "isms"

151
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,240
has no future.

152
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:00,760
Inspector Su, your words

153
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:02,480
remind me of Mr. Sun.

154
00:12:05,150 --> 00:12:07,630
Your scheme to frame me
as a Communist has failed,

155
00:12:07,630 --> 00:12:10,030
and now you want to
frame me as an NBIS agent?

156
00:12:10,390 --> 00:12:11,200
NBIS?

157
00:12:14,070 --> 00:12:15,470
They love money the most.

158
00:12:17,030 --> 00:12:18,080
To be honest,

159
00:12:19,510 --> 00:12:20,910
your level of conviction

160
00:12:21,150 --> 00:12:23,440
puts me to shame.

161
00:12:25,030 --> 00:12:26,830
Whatever your true identity is,

162
00:12:27,030 --> 00:12:28,560
that's none of my business.

163
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:32,150
Every faction keeps changing sides.

164
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:33,280
Who can say for sure?

165
00:12:34,390 --> 00:12:35,850
Whoever makes it to the end

166
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:39,240
still needs money and power
to get there, right?

167
00:12:40,750 --> 00:12:44,000
Isn't all of that—
the fine clothes, the perfume,

168
00:12:44,030 --> 00:12:45,420
that refined lifestyle of yours—

169
00:12:45,420 --> 00:12:47,380
still bought with money?

170
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:53,550
The authorities in Nanjing
have already spoken.

171
00:12:53,550 --> 00:12:54,840
From now on, you'll

172
00:12:55,390 --> 00:12:56,990
have a share in our business.

173
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,650
We're not adversaries.

174
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,970
You never change, do you, Director Li?

175
00:13:05,870 --> 00:13:08,630
I've learned my lesson.

176
00:13:09,020 --> 00:13:11,750
I'll definitely keep a low profile
in the future.

177
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:18,390
Your conviction is
as dependable as ever, Director Li.

178
00:13:18,390 --> 00:13:19,720
I have no choice.

179
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:22,630
Inspector Su,

180
00:13:22,910 --> 00:13:26,040
you can take everything I just said
as drunken nonsense.

181
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:28,760
From now on, we
stay out of each other's way.

182
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:30,440
Show each other a little courtesy,

183
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:32,370
and only then can we both stay safe,

184
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:34,650
don't you think?

185
00:13:53,690 --> 00:13:55,490
I'll help you find this mole.

186
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:00,480
How?

187
00:14:02,030 --> 00:14:03,750
I already have a suspect in mind.

188
00:14:03,750 --> 00:14:05,810
The reason I haven't made a move on him

189
00:14:05,880 --> 00:14:07,340
is that I want to use him as bait

190
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:08,670
to reel in a bigger fish.

191
00:14:11,510 --> 00:14:12,630
I need manpower.

192
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:20,840
You're free to pick from
among the Plum Blossom Agency's agents.

193
00:14:21,780 --> 00:14:22,970
I want Chen Kailai.

194
00:14:24,390 --> 00:14:26,360
That photographer from No. 76?

195
00:14:26,790 --> 00:14:27,390
Yes.

196
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:32,110
What else can he do besides taking photos?

197
00:14:37,870 --> 00:14:38,910
Only Chen Kailai.

198
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:40,670
He's like a brother to me,

199
00:14:41,020 --> 00:14:43,350
and he's a photographer with a sharp mind.

200
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,320
I've received intel

201
00:15:23,570 --> 00:15:26,170
that something's wrong
inside the institute.

202
00:15:26,590 --> 00:15:29,920
Who left the institute yesterday?

203
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:32,720
Yesterday was our monthly day off.

204
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:35,870
Most people left.

205
00:15:36,260 --> 00:15:39,540
Starting today, all leave is canceled.

206
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:43,630
The institute will be under lockdown.

207
00:15:44,150 --> 00:15:47,270
I've sent people to reinforce security.

208
00:15:47,870 --> 00:15:49,150
We must ensure

209
00:15:49,510 --> 00:15:53,670
Project Slumber is carried out safely
before Empire Day.

210
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:58,390
Just station guards at the entrance.

211
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,510
If the Plum Blossom Agency's agents

212
00:16:00,510 --> 00:16:01,670
all come to the labs in droves,

213
00:16:01,670 --> 00:16:03,200
how are we supposed to work?

214
00:16:03,790 --> 00:16:07,910
If we have enough experimental staff,

215
00:16:08,270 --> 00:16:09,750
we won't have to wait until Empire Day.

216
00:16:09,750 --> 00:16:11,750
We could have results by Christmas.

217
00:16:12,390 --> 00:16:15,320
The additional lab staff assigned to you

218
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:17,840
are already on their way.

219
00:16:59,670 --> 00:17:00,630
Kuroba Takuma.

220
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:11,160
Matsumoto Mika.

221
00:17:11,369 --> 00:17:12,099
Yes.

222
00:17:53,070 --> 00:17:54,800
I've gotten word from Hoshino.

223
00:17:56,310 --> 00:17:58,240
To accelerate the experiments,

224
00:17:58,550 --> 00:18:01,270
he's recruiting a few international students
from Japanese universities

225
00:18:01,270 --> 00:18:02,870
to assist with his research.

226
00:18:04,590 --> 00:18:06,070
I've made all the preparations.

227
00:18:06,070 --> 00:18:07,590
I'm standing by for orders.

228
00:18:07,590 --> 00:18:10,120
This is the best chance
to infiltrate the lab.

229
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:13,110
The other candidates aren't ready.

230
00:18:13,110 --> 00:18:16,040
After weighing everything,
you're the best choice.

231
00:18:21,730 --> 00:18:23,190
This is your new identity—

232
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:26,720
a student from Northeast China
studying in Japan.

233
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:30,440
We have someone inside the university.

234
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:31,920
I've arranged everything.

235
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:33,720
He'll find a way to recommend you

236
00:18:33,870 --> 00:18:34,980
so you can join

237
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:37,170
Hoshino's lab as an assistant.

238
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:39,040
Don't worry.

239
00:18:39,160 --> 00:18:40,690
My Japanese is pretty good.

240
00:18:40,830 --> 00:18:42,760
Playing an international student

241
00:18:42,830 --> 00:18:43,890
won't be a problem.

242
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:49,200
Be extremely careful once you join.

243
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:50,790
As far as I know,

244
00:18:51,110 --> 00:18:53,710
there's an NBIS agent
hiding close to Hoshino,

245
00:18:53,790 --> 00:18:55,400
working directly under Guan Yongshan.

246
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:57,530
Only God of Wealth knows his identity.

247
00:18:58,190 --> 00:18:59,990
He'll make your mission harder.

248
00:19:00,550 --> 00:19:02,000
But in an emergency,

249
00:19:02,510 --> 00:19:04,040
you can also make use of him.

250
00:19:05,070 --> 00:19:05,680
Okay.

251
00:19:08,230 --> 00:19:09,030
Take care.

252
00:19:10,510 --> 00:19:11,200
You too.

253
00:19:13,260 --> 00:19:14,920
Make sure you come back alive.

254
00:19:15,810 --> 00:19:16,810
I will.

255
00:19:19,850 --> 00:19:25,790
[Kyoto University Faculty of Medicine]

256
00:19:27,750 --> 00:19:28,510
Hello.

257
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:31,400
May I ask your name, Miss?

258
00:19:32,110 --> 00:19:33,110
Nice to meet you.

259
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:36,750
I'm Matsumoto Mika, from Manchuria.

260
00:19:37,270 --> 00:19:39,310
I hope we all get along well.

261
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:42,240
This way, please.

262
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:43,270
Okay.

263
00:19:54,550 --> 00:19:57,150
Everyone, please line up here
for inspection.

264
00:19:57,300 --> 00:19:58,700
Have your luggage ready.

265
00:20:06,510 --> 00:20:07,400
What's this?

266
00:20:08,310 --> 00:20:09,290
This is honey.

267
00:20:13,350 --> 00:20:15,030
Alright, that's fine.

268
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:35,790
This is Lab 3.

269
00:20:36,470 --> 00:20:38,010
From now on, you'll all work here

270
00:20:38,010 --> 00:20:40,980
and assist Mr. Hoshino with his research.

271
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:43,330
I look forward to working with you all.

272
00:20:43,350 --> 00:20:44,070
Yes!

273
00:21:23,070 --> 00:21:24,590
Bravo!

274
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,110
Beautiful!

275
00:22:09,260 --> 00:22:10,190
Beautiful!

276
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:32,070
Bravo!

277
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:38,570
Half-Immortal Hai?

278
00:22:40,750 --> 00:22:41,880
Have a drink with me.

279
00:23:00,550 --> 00:23:01,950
That girl named Lillian—

280
00:23:02,440 --> 00:23:03,900
what makes her so special?

281
00:23:04,350 --> 00:23:05,720
She even missed a beat.

282
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:08,290
So what if she has someone backing her?

283
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:10,030
I was a star in my day too.

284
00:23:11,990 --> 00:23:14,030
I was also a dancing queen.

285
00:23:17,960 --> 00:23:20,020
It's fine. There's always next year.

286
00:23:25,310 --> 00:23:26,030
What?

287
00:23:43,830 --> 00:23:45,500
Will I even see next year?

288
00:23:51,400 --> 00:23:52,350
Of course.

289
00:23:53,460 --> 00:23:55,430
You're sure to live to 100.

290
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:58,420
I don't want to live to 100.

291
00:23:58,510 --> 00:23:59,570
I'd be old and ugly.

292
00:24:11,270 --> 00:24:12,070
Mr. Dai

293
00:24:13,680 --> 00:24:15,210
is very displeased with me.

294
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:20,520
During this time in Shanghai...

295
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:25,460
not a single thing has gone smoothly.

296
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:31,730
We didn't get the codebook.

297
00:24:32,830 --> 00:24:36,090
Our intelligence network here
was completely destroyed.

298
00:24:37,770 --> 00:24:38,940
Many people died.

299
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:43,240
And there's a mole
inside the Organization.

300
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,270
Revolution

301
00:24:52,370 --> 00:24:54,200
is far harder than we imagined.

302
00:24:55,170 --> 00:24:56,770
You still have me, don't you?

303
00:25:02,430 --> 00:25:03,150
Of course.

304
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:05,530
And Captain Tao too.

305
00:25:08,830 --> 00:25:09,880
Sweet talk.

306
00:25:12,180 --> 00:25:14,440
You can't even handle one dancing queen.

307
00:25:37,830 --> 00:25:38,510
Slow down.

308
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:40,510
You little rascal.

309
00:25:41,630 --> 00:25:44,430
I know you've been
feeling suffocated inside too.

310
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:45,640
You need to vent.

311
00:25:46,110 --> 00:25:47,400
You need to let it out.

312
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:48,790
Let it out, you know?

313
00:25:49,550 --> 00:25:51,350
I really am feeling suffocated.

314
00:25:51,350 --> 00:25:54,150
I feel like I've become
another Young Master Feng.

315
00:25:55,110 --> 00:25:56,350
Stop it.

316
00:25:57,720 --> 00:25:59,050
What's wrong with that?

317
00:25:59,400 --> 00:26:01,260
If you dare, fool around a bit too.

318
00:26:01,790 --> 00:26:02,960
I already kissed you.

319
00:26:02,960 --> 00:26:03,830
It's too late now.

320
00:26:03,830 --> 00:26:05,070
You're my man.

321
00:26:06,570 --> 00:26:07,200
Easy!

322
00:26:08,680 --> 00:26:09,400
Rickshaw!

323
00:26:10,400 --> 00:26:11,230
Stop, stop.

324
00:26:11,260 --> 00:26:12,590
Puller! Puller!

325
00:26:15,450 --> 00:26:16,710
Slow down. Be careful.

326
00:26:54,440 --> 00:26:55,110
Stop!

327
00:26:55,590 --> 00:26:58,880
Who said you could play the piano here?

328
00:26:59,070 --> 00:27:01,400
Sorry. I'm very sorry.

329
00:27:03,590 --> 00:27:04,590
Stop right there.

330
00:27:05,160 --> 00:27:07,270
She's not your prisoner.

331
00:27:13,030 --> 00:27:17,270
She's a researcher
from the Empire of Japan.

332
00:27:18,930 --> 00:27:22,520
Please show her some respect.

333
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:30,310
You play the piano very well.

334
00:27:40,030 --> 00:27:41,030
What's your name?

335
00:27:41,880 --> 00:27:46,270
Matsumoto Mika, from Lab 3.

336
00:27:46,720 --> 00:27:49,160
I've just started working here.

337
00:27:49,640 --> 00:27:52,440
I'm very sorry.

338
00:27:55,070 --> 00:27:56,600
A newly assigned graduate?

339
00:27:56,790 --> 00:27:57,400
Yes.

340
00:27:57,920 --> 00:28:01,110
From the Medical Department
of Kyoto University.

341
00:28:06,550 --> 00:28:09,640
You're not Japanese.

342
00:28:12,140 --> 00:28:16,620
I grew up in Manchuria.

343
00:28:20,030 --> 00:28:22,270
My lab is short of an assistant right now.

344
00:28:22,270 --> 00:28:24,240
Come work in my lab.

345
00:28:27,920 --> 00:28:31,510
There's a better piano in my office.

346
00:28:35,110 --> 00:28:35,680
Yes.

347
00:28:39,350 --> 00:28:39,980
Xin Xiang.

348
00:28:40,750 --> 00:28:42,010
Develop these photos.

349
00:28:43,420 --> 00:28:44,210
Okay, boss.

350
00:28:50,830 --> 00:28:51,480
Hello.

351
00:28:51,480 --> 00:28:52,030
Hello.

352
00:28:52,030 --> 00:28:53,630
Here to have a picture taken?

353
00:28:54,920 --> 00:28:57,640
Are you Mr. Chen from No. 76?

354
00:28:58,310 --> 00:28:58,880
Yes.

355
00:29:00,440 --> 00:29:02,550
I'm General Kagesa's secretary.

356
00:29:08,310 --> 00:29:10,030
General Kagesa is hosting a banquet

357
00:29:10,030 --> 00:29:12,390
for several guests
who've come a long way from Japan

358
00:29:12,390 --> 00:29:14,740
and would like your help taking photos.

359
00:29:16,230 --> 00:29:17,070
Of course.

360
00:29:17,310 --> 00:29:18,110
When?

361
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:20,600
Here's the time and address.

362
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:26,030
Okay.

363
00:29:26,270 --> 00:29:26,920
Thank you.

364
00:29:55,070 --> 00:29:58,400
The people Kagesa is hosting are
the Japanese Military Observer Mission.

365
00:29:58,400 --> 00:30:00,270
They're here to oversee Hoshino's

366
00:30:00,270 --> 00:30:02,070
completion of Project Slumber.

367
00:30:06,270 --> 00:30:07,600
What do you need me to do?

368
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:11,930
Deliver a gift on my behalf.

369
00:30:24,030 --> 00:30:25,890
Someone, come clean up over here.

370
00:30:26,790 --> 00:30:27,790
Hurry up and go.

371
00:30:28,920 --> 00:30:29,550
Yes.

372
00:30:35,740 --> 00:30:37,610
Please clean up the lab waste over there.

373
00:30:37,610 --> 00:30:38,210
Yes.

374
00:31:07,030 --> 00:31:08,890
Tonight at 8, at the Cathay Hotel,

375
00:31:09,510 --> 00:31:13,110
Kagesa is hosting a banquet
for the observer mission from Japan.

376
00:31:13,440 --> 00:31:15,920
Their purpose
in coming to Shanghai this time

377
00:31:15,920 --> 00:31:17,980
is to oversee Hoshino's experiment.

378
00:31:19,550 --> 00:31:20,810
Will Hoshino be there?

379
00:31:23,200 --> 00:31:24,000
Not sure yet.

380
00:31:24,440 --> 00:31:26,440
It'd be great if Hoshino could come.

381
00:31:27,000 --> 00:31:29,200
Then we could take them all out in one go.

382
00:31:30,640 --> 00:31:32,400
Only then can we significantly slow down

383
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:34,260
the progress of Project Slumber.

384
00:31:36,590 --> 00:31:38,790
Whether or not Hoshino comes this time,

385
00:31:38,830 --> 00:31:40,430
our operation must proceed.

386
00:31:46,920 --> 00:31:48,320
They'll stop the car here

387
00:31:49,440 --> 00:31:51,100
on the way to the Cathay Hotel.

388
00:31:51,790 --> 00:31:53,720
You must be ready before they stop.

389
00:31:54,350 --> 00:31:56,480
You'll have only one chance to strike.

390
00:31:56,880 --> 00:31:57,610
Understood.

391
00:31:59,310 --> 00:32:00,070
Also,

392
00:32:01,110 --> 00:32:02,370
before the operation,

393
00:32:02,880 --> 00:32:04,110
clear out the mole.

394
00:32:07,400 --> 00:32:08,660
You've found the mole?

395
00:32:23,500 --> 00:32:26,670
[Laboratory Waste Disposal Room]

396
00:32:42,590 --> 00:32:44,390
Miss, what style would you like?

397
00:32:49,420 --> 00:32:50,750
I want Sichuan brocade,

398
00:32:51,310 --> 00:32:53,770
with Xiangyunsha silk trim
along the edges.

399
00:32:54,270 --> 00:32:56,330
Let me take your measurements first.

400
00:33:22,760 --> 00:33:25,100
[Closed]

401
00:33:50,590 --> 00:33:51,590
Here's the money.

402
00:33:52,790 --> 00:33:54,920
It's been so long since I last saw snow.

403
00:33:57,720 --> 00:33:58,400
Xin Xiang,

404
00:33:58,830 --> 00:34:01,160
go to Qibao Town
and buy me a roast chicken.

405
00:34:01,270 --> 00:34:01,830
Okay.

406
00:34:02,960 --> 00:34:03,960
It's so cold,

407
00:34:04,270 --> 00:34:05,800
and it's over 10 miles away.

408
00:34:10,760 --> 00:34:12,219
He's as obedient as can be,

409
00:34:12,710 --> 00:34:14,710
running errands whenever you call.

410
00:34:15,320 --> 00:34:16,780
Don't underestimate him.

411
00:34:17,630 --> 00:34:19,510
If something ever happens to me,

412
00:34:20,530 --> 00:34:22,190
he'll protect you in my place.

413
00:34:23,920 --> 00:34:25,920
Are you guys planning an operation?

414
00:34:27,110 --> 00:34:29,110
This isn't a good time to make a move.

415
00:34:32,400 --> 00:34:34,000
I don't want to wait anymore.

416
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:35,630
I have to do something

417
00:34:36,219 --> 00:34:37,570
to answer to Mr. Dai

418
00:34:39,110 --> 00:34:41,070
and to those who died.

419
00:35:54,120 --> 00:35:54,890
Kailai.

420
00:36:29,250 --> 00:36:30,210
General Kagesa

421
00:36:30,630 --> 00:36:33,490
is hosting
important Japanese officials tonight.

422
00:36:33,510 --> 00:36:34,310
What's wrong?

423
00:36:35,760 --> 00:36:38,760
I suspect the Hurricane Team
will make a move tonight.

424
00:37:10,590 --> 00:37:11,670
Why so tense?

425
00:37:12,740 --> 00:37:14,940
Why do you always show up out of nowhere?

426
00:37:15,550 --> 00:37:16,680
Who told you to come?

427
00:37:18,070 --> 00:37:21,400
Kagesa asked me to come
and photograph his Japanese guests.

428
00:37:21,590 --> 00:37:22,320
Good timing.

429
00:37:23,220 --> 00:37:25,970
You're in for a good show tonight.

430
00:37:27,370 --> 00:37:28,230
What good show?

431
00:38:11,800 --> 00:38:12,510
Come here!

432
00:38:26,130 --> 00:38:27,190
I've noticed you've been

433
00:38:27,190 --> 00:38:29,190
walking around here several times.

434
00:38:29,620 --> 00:38:31,220
Are you looking for someone?

435
00:38:32,080 --> 00:38:33,120
Y-Yes, sir.

436
00:39:57,220 --> 00:39:58,480
Where is God of Wealth?

437
00:40:31,070 --> 00:40:32,300
Clear the area immediately!

438
00:40:32,300 --> 00:40:33,060
-Yes!
-Yes!

439
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:34,670
Hurry up!

440
00:41:13,970 --> 00:41:15,180
The show's over.

441
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:20,440
How did you know
the Hurricane Team would act tonight?

442
00:41:22,660 --> 00:41:23,460
Don't forget—

443
00:41:24,480 --> 00:41:27,630
my nose can sniff out any kind of danger.

444
00:42:11,710 --> 00:42:12,480
The road is slippery. Please be careful.

445
00:42:12,480 --> 00:42:13,150
Thank you.

446
00:42:13,150 --> 00:42:13,880
Sir.

447
00:42:16,030 --> 00:42:18,150
The snow has already piled up

448
00:42:18,820 --> 00:42:20,280
without us even noticing.

449
00:42:24,330 --> 00:42:25,170
Mr. Du,

450
00:42:26,040 --> 00:42:27,640
you did a great job this time.

451
00:42:27,750 --> 00:42:28,880
Thank you, General.

452
00:42:30,890 --> 00:42:32,750
Shall we take a picture together?

453
00:42:33,870 --> 00:42:35,400
Sure, let's take a picture.

454
00:42:55,710 --> 00:42:57,710
This is your first mission

455
00:42:58,070 --> 00:42:58,840
as a member of the Hurricane Team.
